<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Introduction">Introduction</span></h2>
<p>The <b>Dragon Age Community Contest</b> is a content-creation contest organised by the Dragon Age community for the Dragon Age community. <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Community%20Contest%20Prizes" title="Community Contest Prizes">Prizes</a>, which vary between contests, are generously donated by community members and our sponsors, the <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://biowarestore.com">Bioware Store</a> and <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/">Dragon Age Nexus</a>. All work submitted to the contest will be freely available for all to use and modify in mods and can be viewed in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Community%20Contest%20Catalogue" title="Community Contest Catalogue">Community Contest Catalogue</a>.
</p><p>To discuss the Community Contest, with questions or suggestions as entrant or organiser, please join our <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://social.bioware.com/group/2535">Bioware Social Network Group</a>.
</p>
